    "created_at": "2026-10-19T14:10:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-19T14:10:34Z",
    "body": "I just created a PR\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/compat/pull/299\n\nOn `getComputedStyle()`: csswg-drafts#717 is closed (merged into https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/2149, which resolved that it supports non-slotted pseudo-elements and throws for unknown ones).\n\nContext: \n* WebKit already lists it as an alias of `placeholder`, \n* Blink accepts it, \n* Firefox is adding it in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2083700 after a just-eat.es rule `::-webkit-input-placeholder { opacity: 0 }` was dropped. \n\nMaybe we need to add a new WPT in the compat section.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
